
Q1: batao agar ek mcp ya tool me koi file ya sppose kro koi transaction h backend me complete ho gya but user ko failed and agent retry lgya h toh woh fir se multiple hit krke multiple transaction complete kr rha hai user ko pta hi nhi chl rha hai toh yha kya failures h kaise pta kre and kya kaise resolve kre
kya hm aise scenarios k liye webhooks, pooling or any other things use kr skte h

Ans:

Ye classic **production bug** hai: backend pe **transaction already commit** ho chuki, lekin **agent/user** ko **timeout / failed** dikha — phir **retry** se **duplicate money / file / order** ban gaye. Isko **Ambiguous Failure + Non-Idempotent Tool Retry** kehte hain.

```
User / Agent
 └── Goal: ek business action 1 baar hi complete ho
      └── Context: MCP tool, network drop, timeout, agent auto-retry
           ├── Facts: backend commit OK, client response lost
           ├── Surfaces: tool args, HTTP, queue, DB, wallet, file store
           └── Risk: duplicate txn, silent money leak, user trust break
                └── Path A first: Idempotency Key + Status Lookup (cloud inbuilt)
                     └── Path B: existing ledger / order service reuse
                          └── Path C: HITL on money / write tools
                               └── Path D: custom dedup + saga
                                    └── Signal: duplicate_rate, unique constraint, trace
                                         └── Decision: lookup → reuse result, naya hit mat maaro
```

---

## Problem 1 line
**Commit ho gaya, response nahi aaya** → agent ne **Failed** maan ke **same intent** ko **naya request** bana diya.

```
User intent (Pay ₹500 / upload file)
 └── Agent tool call  #1
      └── Backend COMMIT  ✅
           └── Response timeout / MCP disconnect  ❌
                └── Agent retry policy
                     └── Tool call #2, #3...
                          └── COMMIT #2, #3  ← user ko pata nahi
```

---

## Yahan kaun-kaun si **failures** hain

| Failure | Kya hota hai | User ko kya dikhta hai |
|---|---|---|
| **Ambiguous timeout** | Server **success**, client **no response** | Failed / pending |
| **Non-idempotent POST** | Har retry **naya row / naya debit** | 1 click, 3 charges |
| **New `request_id` on retry** | Agent har baar naya ID banata hai | Backend sochta hai naya txn |
| **MCP disconnect after side-effect** | Tool process khatam, JSON-RPC toot gaya | Agent “tool error” |
| **Partial success** | Wallet cut, receipt nahi / file S3 pe, DB fail | Inconsistent state |
| **At-least-once queue** | Pub/Sub / SQS **re-delivery** | Duplicate worker run |
| **Agent loop / max retries** | 3–5 auto retries without **status check** | Silent multi-hit |
| **Wrong error mapping** | `504` ko **business fail** maana | Retry of already-done work |
| **No unique constraint** | DB duplicate accept kar leta hai | Ledger drift |
| **No reconciliation** | Ops ko late pata chalta hai | User ticket baad mein |

Important baat: ye **LLM hallucination** nahi, **distributed systems** ka **at-least-once** problem hai. Agent sirf isko **tez** aur **andaaza-se** worse bana deta hai.

