## Aur options (short)

- **Request-reply queue:** tool message bus par, reply correlation_id se — MCP timeout ≠ work fail
- **Saga + compensate:** do systems; webhook fail par refund nahi, pehle status
- **Transactional outbox:** commit aur “notify agent” ek DB transaction mein
- **Dedup window:** Redis `SET intent NX EX 86400`
- **User-visible PENDING:** “Fail” mat likho jab tak terminal state na aaye — yahi se galat retry start hota hai

